{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38320","headline":"红白牡丹 · 吴融","name":"红白牡丹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不必繁弦不必歌，静中相对更情多。\n殷鲜一半霞分绮，洁澈旁边月颭波。\n看久愿成庄叟梦，惜留须倩鲁阳戈。\n重来应共今来别，风堕香残衬绿莎。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38320.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38320","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}